Short:        V1.1 generates SAS/C MakeFiles, w/source
Author:       raydar@netcom.com (Ray Darrah III)
Uploader:     raydar netcom com (Ray Darrah III)
Type:         dev/c
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

DependantScan V1.1 automatically creates and maintains SAS/C makefiles.
Main features include:

- usable from the WorkBench or the CLI
- many configurable items
- full AmigaGuide documentation
- well commented source code included
